               "body" : {
                  "content" : [
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "MAYBE related bug report/issue: NOT SURE GOOD IDEA - mAYBE already done",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : " ",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "Ø  Add “BuildPlatform” – what is sometimes called ‘host’ in some build systems – and allow Unix, and Cygwin, for now. Autodetect and set into configuration files.",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "o    Then – for the ‘all configurations’ scripts – like iterating over all configruations – just do the ones that match between autodetected BuildPlatform and one in that configuration field.",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "o    That will allow BLOW and Cygwin builds to co-exist side-by-side (I hope). Maybe not cuz of symbolic links! – for IntermedaiteFiles etc – but it’s a start – and maybe…",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : " ",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     }
                  ],
